 "_about_page_coins": "Coins added on Cloudflare (14 Nov 2026). Their two tabs are made by tools/page.js from the ETH Daily and ETH 4H tabs of the original page, with only the coin, its data and its history start changed. Their forecast logs start empty.",
 "title": "BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB &amp; USDT.D Fib Top Tracker",
 "_about_usdtd": "USDT.D (owner, 20 Nov 2026): USDT dominance, %, from TradingView via Market-Data (daily 1D history from 2015, then days made from closed 4H candles; 4H as loaded). The unchanged engine rounds prices to whole numbers, so the build feeds USDT.D x1000 (scale) and the USDT.D tabs show prices divided by 1000 as % (pct_scale; tools/page.js + shim.js). A projected USDT.D top is a peak in USDT dominance, which has tended to line up with a crypto low. 4H tab added 21 Nov 2026 once Market-Data held USDT.D 4H back to 2024-01-01 (owner's PC upload, about 6,330 candles)."
